{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>重視私隱的用家與經常外出的商務人士，往往不希望對話內容上傳雲端。AiGoodbye 把人工智能模型直接放在 iPhone 與 iPad 上，離線完成對話、會議轉錄與文件問答，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-201.webp\">\n<h2>離線對話與會議轉錄</h2>\n<p>AiGoodbye 將人工智能模型直接安裝在 iPhone 與 iPad 上，全程離線運作，毋須帳戶或訂閱。用家可免持手對話，會議期間即時轉錄並一鍵生成重點與待辦事項，亦支援 13 種語言雙向語音翻譯。鏡頭可辨識相片、截圖與手寫筆記，並把紙本文件掃描成文字；內置私密記憶與 Face ID 鎖。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-244-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-245-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-246-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-247-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-248-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AiGoodbye</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T00:58:54.857759+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:55:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:50.864248+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:57:35.842732+00:00","content_hash":"222f0b55ebb2fde498dd02ba46b5e11c74ccd0693ec54d7c67ed5f17289a6ad0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}